      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EST 5:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aha kiro kya kashatu Esteeri yaajwara ebijwaro bye by'obwigarire, yaaza omu kibuga ky'omugabe eky'omunda, yaayemerera aharikureebana n'enju y'omugabe; kandi omugabe akaba ashutami aha kitebe ky'obugabe omuri nyaruju ye, aharikureebana n'eirembo eririkutaaha omu kibuga. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EST.5.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EST.5.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EST 5:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "EST.4.11"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Est 4:11",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "EST.8.4"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "8:4",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Omugabe ku yaarebire omwigarire Esteeri ayemereire omu kibuga, yaamushemerererwa, yaamwimukiza enkoni y'ezaabu eyaabaire eri omu ngaro ze. Atyo Esteeri yairira haihi, yaakora aha ifundo ryayo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EST.5.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EST.5.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EST 5:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "EST.7.2"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Est 7:2",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "MRK.6.23"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Mak 6:23",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Omugabe yaamubuuza ati: Omwigarire Esteeri, oine eki orikwenda? Nooshaba ki? Eki orikushaba kyona ninkikuha, n'obu kyakuba ekicweka ky'obugabe bwangye. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EST.5.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EST.5.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EST 5:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Esteeri yaagira ati: Nyakusinga omguabe, ku oraabe nookisiima, eri izooba oije na Hamani aha bugyenyi obu nkuteekateekyeire. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EST.5.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EST.5.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EST 5:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omugabe yaagira ati: Nimwete Hamani juba, eki Esteeri arikwenda kikorwe. Atyo omugabe na Hamani baija aha bugyenyi obu Esteeri yaabaire abateekateekyeire. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EST.5.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EST.5.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EST 5:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ku baabaire nibanywa viinyo, omugabe yaamugira ati: N'enki, Omwigarire Esteeri? nooshaba ki, okakiheebwa? Noija kukiheebwa, n'obu kiraabe ekicweka ky'obugabe bwangye. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EST.5.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EST.5.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EST 5:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Esteeri yaamugarukamu ati: Eki ndikushaba, kandi eki ndikwenda nikyo eki. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EST.5.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EST.5.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EST 5:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ku ndaabe ndi ow'okugirirwa embabazi omu maisho g'omugabe, kandi omugabe ku araaba naakisiima kumpa eki ndikushaba, n'okuhikiiriza eki ndikwenda, omugabe na Hamani bagarukye nyencakare aha bugyenyi obu ndaabateekateekyere; obwo nibwo ndaakore eki omugabe yaagamba.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EST.5.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EST.5.8"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
