            {
              "text": "\n",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "EST.3.5"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Est 3:5",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Eryo izooba Hamani yaashohora ashemereirwe kandi ananukire. Ku yaareebire Morodekai ari omu irembo ry'omugabe ataamwimukira n'obu kwakuba kumuhigiza, yaamugirira ekiniga kingi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EST.5.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EST.5.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EST 5:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kwonka yaagumisiriza, yaataaha omuka, yaatuma kweta banywani be n'omukazi we Zereshi; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EST.5.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EST.5.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EST 5:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "EST.3.1"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Est 3:1",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "EST.9.7+EST.9.8+EST.9.9+EST.9.10"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "9:7-10",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " yaabagambira ekitiinisa eki aine ahabw'obutungi bwe, abaana be ku bari baingi, na byona ebi omugabe amukurizemu, akamutunguura okukira abanyiginya n'abandi bagaragwa be. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EST.5.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EST.5.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EST 5:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kandi Hamani yaagaruka yaagira ati: Nangwa n'omwigarire Esteeri tiyaayeta ondiijo kwija n'omugabe aha bugyenyi kureka nyowe nyenka. Kandi na hati yaanyeta n'omugabe aha bugyenyi nyencakare. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EST.5.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EST.5.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EST 5:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "EST.2.19"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Est 2:19",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Kwonka ebyo byona tibiine ki birikungasira, ninkireeba ogwo Muyudaaya Morodekai ashutami omu irembo ry'omugabe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EST.5.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EST.5.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EST 5:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bwanyima Zereshi omukazi we n'abanywani be boona baamugira bati: Ka bakore ekiti ky'oburaingwa bwa mikono makumi ataano, kibyarwe; omu kasheeshe ogambire omugabe, bakihanikyeho Morodekai, obone kuza aha bugyenyi n'omugabe oshemereirwe. Egyo naama yaashemeza Hamani; yaabyara ekyo kiti.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EST.5.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EST.5.14"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
